	<section_number>45.2-504</section_number>
	<catch_line> Age requirement to work in mines</catch_line>
	<text>
		<section prefix="A">No person under 18 years of age shall be permitted to work in or around any mine.
		</section>
		<section prefix="B">No operator, agent, or mine foreman shall make a false statement as to the age of any person under 18 years of age applying for work in or around any mine.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-16; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-32; 1972, c. 154; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.11; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
